,{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回birthdayライブ延期になっちゃったのでそれを超えるようなににかをできればということで！\nみんなで46時間やってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送もとっても多いので早朝からバタバタとしております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜もう明後日は２月22日か〜あっというま！早いですぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日1日無駄にしたらダメだねほんとに‥\n\n\nみなさんのおかげでこの日を毎年迎えれてるなぁと毎年改めて思う日でもあります。\n\n\nまぁ明後日なんですけど、こうして46時間TVやってるとそぉ思いました‥\n\n\nこれからも感謝の気持ちを忘れず、がんばっていくぞぉぉぉっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてよゐこの濱口さんの弟！よっちゃんさんが私達を占ってくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全体で仕事運も2位で急上昇運も2位で\nとても嬉しかったですー٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/02/21/1220382/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ボーリング大会下手っぴだったけどがんばりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler